<title>USA: Sarah Scott MCBC, Ind., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Sarah Scott MCBC, Ind., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc., said it won $22.665 million of Sarah Scott Middle School Bldg. Corp., Ind., first mortgage bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.79 percent.</p>
</text>
